{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n156.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","n":"67","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n156.jpg"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:head","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"en"}}
{"text":"Abinu Malkenu"}
{"end":"t:head"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/chatanu"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, we have sinned before Thee. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/ein_lanu"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, we have no king but Thee. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/aseh_immanu"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, deal with us kindly for the sake of Thy Name. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/chaddesh"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, renew for us a good year. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/batel_gezerot"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, annul all harsh decrees from upon us. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/batel_machshevot"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, annul the plans of those that hate us. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/hafer"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, frustrate the counsel of our enemies. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/kaleh_tzar"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, avert every foe and adversary from upon us. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/kaleh_dever"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, avert pestilence, sword, famine, captivity and destruction from the children of Thy covenant. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/mena"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, hold back plague from Thine inheritance. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/shelach"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, send complete healing to the sick of Thy people. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/hachazirenu"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, restore us in complete repentance before Thee. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/selach"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, pardon and forgive all our sins. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/mecheh"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, blot out our transgressions and let them pass away from before Thine eyes. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/qera"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, tear up the severe verdict decreed against us. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/mechoq"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, erase in Thy great compassion all the records of our faults. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/zekhor"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, remember that we are dust. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/zokhrenu"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, remember us benevolently before Thee. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/kotvenu_chayyim"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, inscribe us in the book of good life. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n158.jpg","n":"68"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/kotvenu_zekhuyyot"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, inscribe us in the book of merits. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/kotvenu_parnasah"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, inscribe us in the book of livelihood and sustenance. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/kotvenu_geullah"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, inscribe us in the book of redemption and salvation. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/kotvenu_selichah"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, inscribe us in the book of pardon and forgiveness. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/hatzmach"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, let salvation soon spring forth for us. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/harem_yisrael"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, raise the condition of Thy people. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/harem_meshichekha"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, raise the condition of Thine anointed. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/shema"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, hear our voice, spare us and have mercy on us. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/qabbel"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, accept our prayer with compassion and favour. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/al_teshivenu"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, do not send us back empty from before Thee. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/aseh_harugim"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, act for the sake of those slain for the sanctification of Thy Name. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/aseh_tevuchim"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, act for the sake of those slaughtered for Thy unity. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/aseh_baei"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, act for the sake of those that go through fire and water for the sanctification of Thy Name. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/neqom"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, revenge before our eyes the blood of Thy servants that was shed. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/aseh_lemaankha"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, act for Thine own sake, if not for our sake. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/aseh_vehoshienu"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, act for Thine own sake and save us. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/aseh_rachamekha"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, act for the sake of Thy great compassion. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/aseh_shimkha"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, act for the sake of Thy great, mighty and awe-inspiring Name that has been called over us. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:avinu_malkenu/chonnenu"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Our Father, our King, be gracious and answer us for we have no good deeds. Deal with us in clemency and kindness and save us. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"petition"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n      "}
{"end":"t:div"}
